# A ninth Russian story: New Year at Masha's
subtitle: "Read Tom's New Year at Masha's family, fifteen lines built from lessons 1–89 with only three glosses: her dad with the beard, the tallest brother, the best soup in the world, wishes at midnight. Hear it line by line, test yourself by eye and by ear, say a line, and look back at lessons 61–90."
tags: ["russian","russian reading","russian story","new year","russian a2"]
teaches: ["reading/reading-stories"]
thumb: "band \"A ninth story: New Year at Masha's\" note \"lessons 81–89, 15 lines\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"At the airport in Russian: паспорт, рейс","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/91-russian-airport.cast"}

## A ninth Russian story: New Year at Masha's
level: basic
heading: false

    glossed s1 "Тридца́ть пе́рвое декабря́. Я был у Ма́ши." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s2 "Её па́па высо́кий, с бородо́й." say_voice a gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s3 "Ма́ша о́чень похо́жа на па́пу." say_voice a gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s4 "А её брат Ива́н — са́мый высо́кий в семье́." say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 190 width 990 font_size 44 hidden true
    glossed s5 "Ёлка уже́ стоя́ла, а ма́ма была́ ещё на ку́хне." say_voice a gloss ["fir tree","","stood","","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 610 width 990 font_size 40 hidden true
    glossed s6 "«Том, ты гото́в?» — «Коне́чно, гото́в!»" say_voice a gloss ["","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 430 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s7 "Па́па: «По-мо́ему, э́то лу́чший суп в ми́ре!»" say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 250 width 990 font_size 42 hidden true
    glossed s8 "Ма́ма была́ ра́да, а Ива́н сказа́л:" say_voice a gloss ["","","","","",""] show_gloss after read_first true x 500 y 640 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
    glossed s9 "«Я иногда́ ре́жу хлеб, но суп никогда́ не варю́!»" say_voice a gloss ["","","","","","","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 490 width 990 font_size 38 hidden true
    glossed s10 "Мне бы́ло о́чень ве́село." say_voice a gloss ["","","",""] show_gloss after x 500 y 340 width 990 font_size 46 hidden true
